#. module: kdvn_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kdvn_website.company_history_page
msgid "From Japan’s engineering heritage to Vietnam’s industrial development"
msgstr "日本の技術の伝統から、ベトナムの産業発展へ"

#. module: kdvn_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kdvn_website.company_history_page
msgid "<strong>KINDEN CORPORATION</strong> was established in Japan in <strong>1944</strong> and has since developed extensive engineering expertise worldwide. Building on this heritage, Kinden Vietnam has developed long-term engineering capabilities and experience in Vietnam."
msgstr "<strong>株式会社きんでん</strong>は<strong>1944年</strong>に日本で設立され、以来、世界各地で幅広い技術力を培ってきました。この伝統を受け継ぎ、きんでんベトナムはベトナムにおいて長年にわたり技術力と経験を積み重ねてきました。"

#. module: kdvn_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kdvn_website.company_history_page
msgid "The First President Norishige Satake"
msgstr "初代社長 Norishige Satake"

#. module: kdvn_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kdvn_website.company_history_page
msgid "80+ Years of Engineering Heritage"
msgstr "80年以上にわたる技術の歴史"

#. module: kdvn_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kdvn_website.company_history_page
msgid "KINDEN CORPORATION was established in Japan in 1944 and has since grown into one of Japan’s leading integrated facility engineering companies, with a global track record across electrical, mechanical and communication systems."
msgstr "株式会社きんでんは1944年に日本で設立され、以来、電気・機械・通信設備の分野で世界的な実績を持つ、日本有数の総合設備エンジニアリング企業へと成長しました。"

#. module: kdvn_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kdvn_website.company_history_page
msgid "Explore KINDEN CORPORATION History"
msgstr "きんでんの歩みを見る"

